Short:        ACE in FinalWriter format - System
Author:       Anders Bjerin
Uploader:     Ben Straub <straub presys com>
Type:         dev/c
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

I thought that the original ACE was kind of dumpy-looking when you printed it
out, so I sprang into action! The end result is this, the ready-to-print (and
much better-looking, IMHO) Amiga C Encyclopedia.

Anders Bjerin is the original author of the ACE, I (Ben Straub) only
reformatted it into a more readable form and fixed a few typos. These are only
the `shareware' versions of these documents; you will have to pay for the full
versions. See the ACE archives for more info.



